{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:28427fa78a230e42","name":"Aim","source":{"id":"source:reference-28427fa78a230e42","title":"Aim","revision":15771,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:09Z","sha256":"6f5e371b9e5cd1e0a8192c91d945e155dc02dc1f83914f912a875184f1cee447","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15771","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Aim&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-28427fa78a230e42","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can take two consecutive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," in the same round to more carefully line up a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},". When you do so, you ignore all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonuses to your target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," on your next attack. You still must have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target, however. You lose the benefits of Aiming if you lose line of sight to your target or if you take any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Action"}," before making your attack. Aiming provides no benefit when making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Careful Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Careful_Shot","referenceId":"reference:efcc94415279370b"}," feat, you gain a +1 bonus on your ranged attack roll when you take the time to Aim first. If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deadeye"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deadeye","referenceId":"reference:ac11f8bbbd2a07f8"}," feat, you deal an extra die of damage when you take the time to Aim first.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Vehicle Combat"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Just as in Character Combat, you can Aim with two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," before making a ranged attack. When you do so, you ignore all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonuses to your target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," on your next attack. You still must have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target, however. You lose the benefits of Aiming if you lose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to your target or if you take any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Action"}," before making your attack. Aiming provides no benefit when making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
